LAB) — official announcement of the Stellar Swirl reaction for Version 7.0</a></li></ul></section><aside class="my-12 rounded-xl border border-[#D4A853]/20 bg-[#0c0c18]/60 p-5 flex gap-4 items-start"><img src="/images/mythras-logo-200.webp" alt="Mythras" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="rounded-full border border-[#D4A853]/30 shrink-0"/><div class="text-sm text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed"><div class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D4A853]/70 mb-1">Written by</div><p class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Mythras</p><p>Mythras has been making gaming strategy content since 2022 across a multi-channel YouTube presence with thousands of gameplay videos. Every guide here comes from hands-on play and testing — not aggregated from other sites.<!-- --> <a class="text-[#D4A853] hover:text-[#F0C850]" href="/about">More about Mythras</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@cookierunmythras" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#D4A853] hover:text-[#F0C850]">YouTube</a></p></div></aside><aside id="amazon-picks" class="my-10 rounded-xl border border-[#D4A853]/20 bg-[#0c0c18]/60 p-5"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 mb-4"><div class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D4A853]/70">Recommended<!-- --> <span class="text-[#c8c8d4]">· affiliate</span></div><p class="text-xs text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed">As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases — at no extra cost to you.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=genshin%20impact%20figure&amp;tag=mythras2026-20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored" data-mythras-kind="search" data-mythras-placement="post-grid" data-mythras-game="genshin-impact" class="group flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-[#D4A853]/15 bg-[#12121f]/60 overflow-hidden hover:border-[#D4A853]/40 transition-all"><div cl