-[#D4A853]/15 bg-[#0c0c18]/60 p-5"><div class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D4A853]/70 mb-3">Continue on YouTube</div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-2xl leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">🎮</span><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed mb-3">Watch <!-- -->more gaming<!-- --> videos on <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Mythras Gaming</strong> — real gameplay and testing from the channel behind this site.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#D4A853] hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors" href="/channels/mythras-gaming">Browse the channel here<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-tDHOeoDgUaXxIkQBFffAg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#c8c8d4] hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors">Subscribe on YouTube<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></aside><footer class="my-12 pt-6 border-t border-[#D4A853]/15 text-sm text-[#9999aa]">Last updated <strong class="text-white font-medium">September 4, 2026</strong>.</footer></div><section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 my-16"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6" style="font-family:var(--font-display)">Related Guides</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><a class="group block glass-panel rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D4A853]/10 hover:border-[#D4A853]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-damage-formula-guide"><div class="aspect-video bg-[#0c0c18] overflow-hidden border-b border-[#D4A853]/10"><img src="/images/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-damage-formula-guide/hero-mona.webp" alt="Mona in her purple and black astrologer outfit against a starfield backdrop, the Hydro catalyst user whose Stellaris Phantasm burst is used in the official wiki walkthrough of the damage formula." loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300"/></div><div class="p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-xs text-[#9999aa]"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#D4A853]/10 text-[#F0C850] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[10px]"><span>🧠</span><span>Advanced Strategy</span></span><span>Jul 29, 2026</span><span class="text-[#55556a]">·</span><span>11<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors leading-snug mb-2" style="font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:0.01em">Genshin Damage Formula Guide — Which Multiplier Your Build Is Missing</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">A level 90 character hitting a level 90 enemy loses exactly half its damage before resistance, before crits, before anything you can see. That 0.5 is not difficulty tuning — it falls straight out of one line of arithmetic, and it is the reason your next upgrade probably is not another CRIT DMG roll.</p><div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4A853] group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Read article<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></div></a><a class="group block glass-panel rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D4A853]/10 hover:border-[#D4A853]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-energy-recharge-guide"><div class="aspect-video bg-[#0c0c18] overflow-hidden border-b border-[#D4A853]/10"><img src="/images/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-energy-recharge-guide/hero-xingqiu.webp" alt="Xingqiu in his dark blue and gold Liyue robes surrounded by floating Hydro Rain Swords, the four-star support whose Elemental Skill drops five Hydro particles per cast." loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300"/></div><div class="p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-xs text-[#9999aa]"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#D4A853]/10 text-[#F0C850] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[10px]"><span>🧠</span><span>Advanced Strategy</span></span><span>Jul 26, 2026</span><span class="text-[#55556a]">·</span><span>12<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors leading-snug mb-2" style="font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:0.01em">Genshin Energy Recharge Guide — How Much ER You Actually Need</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">Xingqiu drops exactly five Hydro particles per skill cast. Standing on him when they land is worth 15 Energy. Swapping away first is worth 9. Same cooldown, same rotation, six Energy gone — and that is before you touch the Energy Recharge stat at all.</p><div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4A853] group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Read article<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></div></a><a class="group block glass-panel rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D4A853]/10 hover:border-[#D4A853]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-elemental-reactions-guide"><div class="aspect-video bg-[#0c0c18] overflow-hidden border-b border-[#D4A853]/10"><img src="/images/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-elemental-reactions-guide/hero-nahida.webp" alt="Nahida, the Dendro Archon, whose kit made Dendro reactions like Hyperbloom and Aggravate the backbone of modern Genshin Impact team building." loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300"/></div><div class="p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-xs text-[#9999aa]"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#D4A853]/10 text-[#F0C850] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[10px]"><span>🧠</span><span>Advanced Strategy</span></span><span>Jul 20, 2026</span><span class="text-[#55556a]">·</span><span>12<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors leading-snug mb-2" style="font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:0.01em">Genshin Elemental Reactions Guide — Every Multiplier Explained</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">Most players know Hydro plus Pyro equals Vaporize. Far fewer know that swapping which element lands first is the difference between a 2x multiplier and a 1.5x one — the same rotation, a third of the damage gone.</p><div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4A853] group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Read article<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></div></a><a class="group block glass-panel rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D4A853]/10 hover:border-[#D4A853]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-flins-build-guide"><div class="aspect-video bg-[#0c0c18] overflow-hidden border-b border-[#D4A853]/10"><img src="/images/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-flins-build-guide/hero-flins.webp" alt="Flins, Genshin Impact&#x27;s Nod-Krai Lightkeeper, in his character showcase art with his lantern-spear Pocztowy Demonspear." loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300"/></div><div class="p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-xs text-[#9999aa]"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#D4A853]/10 text-[#F0C850] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[10px]"><span>⚔️</span><span>Team Builds</span></span><span>Sep 4, 2026</span><span class="text-[#55556a]">·</span><span>12<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors leading-snug mb-2" style="font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:0.01em">Genshin Flins Build Guide — Talents, Weapon, Artifacts</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">Flins does not poke a shield and walk away. His whole kit is a two-stage transformation that turns his own Elemental Skill and Burst into direct Lunar-Charged hits, which means the stat priorities and artifact math for a normal Electro DPS do not apply to him. Here is what actually moves his damage, talent by talent.</p><div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4A853] group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Read article<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></div></a><a class="group block glass-panel rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D4A853]/10 hover:border-[#D4A853]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-artifact-guide"><div class="aspect-video bg-[#0c0c18] overflow-hidden border-b border-[#D4A853]/10"><img src="/images/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-artifact-guide/hero-hu-tao.webp" alt="Hu Tao, a Pyro carry whose damage output depends almost entirely on artifact substat quality rather than character investment." loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300"/></div><div class="p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-xs text-[#9999aa]"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#D4A853]/10 text-[#F0C850] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[10px]"><span>🎮</span><span>Game Guides</span></span><span>Jul 20, 2026</span><span class="text-[#55556a]">·</span><span>13<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors leading-snug mb-2" style="font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:0.01em">Genshin Artifact Guide — Stats, Rolls and Resin Math</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">A five-star artifact can roll the exact same substat four times and give you anywhere from 10.88 percent to 15.54 percent CRIT DMG. Understanding that spread is the difference between a functional account and a museum of half-built characters.</p><div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4A853] group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Read article<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></div></a><a class="group block glass-panel rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#D4A853]/10 hover:border-[#D4A853]/40 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-stygian-onslaught-guide"><div class="aspect-video bg-[#0c0c18] overflow-hidden border-b border-[#D4A853]/10"><img src="/images/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-stygian-onslaught-guide/hero-stygian-onslaught.webp" alt="The unlocked Stygian Onslaught event menu in Genshin Impact, showing the ley line disturbance challenge at Sal Terrae in Liyue." loading="lazy" class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-300"/></div><div class="p-5 md:p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-xs text-[#9999aa]"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#D4A853]/10 text-[#F0C850] font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[10px]"><span>🧠</span><span>Advanced Strategy</span></span><span>Aug 15, 2026</span><span class="text-[#55556a]">·</span><span>14<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors leading-snug mb-2" style="font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:0.01em">Genshin Stygian Onslaught Guide — The Primogems Stop at Difficulty Three</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">Genshin has three permanent endgames. The third one hands you its entire Primogem payout at difficulty three of six, then spends the top half of the ladder paying you in artifact currency and weapon skins instead. The reward table is the whole strategy.</p><div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#D4A853] group-hover:gap-2 transition-all">Read article<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div></div></a></div></section></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="relative border-t border-[#D4A853]/10"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 mb-12"><div class="md:col-span-1"><a class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4" href="/"><div class="relative w-10 h-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-[#D4A853]/30 bg-[#060610]"><img alt="Mythras" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/images/mythras-logo-200.webp"/></div><span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-wider text-gradient" style="font-family:var(--font-display)">MYTHRAS</span></a><p class="text-sm text-[#9999aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">Player-tested guides, five YouTube channels, and the Multiverse — the Mythras membership community.</p><div class="flex gap-3"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGp83Usm4riRWlAYa9F2diQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#D4A853]/5 flex items-center justify-center text-[#9999aa] hover:text-[#D4A853] hover:bg-[#D4A853]/10 transition-all"><svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"></path></svg></a><a href="https://www.twitch.tv/3mythras3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Twitch" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#D4A853]/5 flex items-center justify-center text-[