onduct-builds-a-field-that-pays-by-the-hit\",\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853]/60 text-xs mt-0.5\",\"children\":\"↳\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Stellar-Conduct Builds a Field That Pays by the Hit\"}]]}]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"li\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"ml-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#stellar-swirl-is-the-one-that-chains\",\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853]/60 text-xs mt-0.5\",\"children\":\"↳\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Stellar Swirl Is the One That Chains\"}]]}]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"li\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#building-for-lunar-and-stellar-damage\",\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853]/60 text-xs mt-0.5\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Building for Lunar and Stellar Damage\"}]]}]}]\n49:[\"$\",\"li\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#what-still-holds-from-the-classic-reaction-rules\",\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853]/60 text-xs mt-0.5\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"What Still Holds From the Classic Reaction Rules\"}]]}]}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#quick-action-checklist\",\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] hover:text-[#F0C850] transition-colors flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853]/60 text-xs mt-0.5\",\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Quick Action Checklist\"}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"id\":\"the-reaction-chart-grew-while-you-were-farming\",\"className\":\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[#D4A853]/15 scroll-mt-24\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"var(--font-display)\"},\"children\":\"The Reaction Chart Grew While You Were Farming\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[15px] md:text-base\",\"children\":[\"For four years the Genshin reaction chart was a closed book. Seven elements, four mechanical families, and one iron rule: only the stats of the character who triggers the reaction count. Whole guides — including \",[\"$\",\"$L18\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/blog/genshin-impact/genshin-elemental-reactions-guide\",\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853] underline decoration-[#D4A853]/30 underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#F0C850] hover:decoration-[#D4A853]/70 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"ours\"}],\" — were built on that foundation.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[15px] md:text-base\",\"children\":\"Between Version 5.8 and Version 7.0, which released on 12 August 2026, HoYoverse added five reactions that do not play by them. The three Lunar Reactions — Lunar-Charged, Lunar-Bloom and Lunar-Crystallize — and the two Stellar Glimmer Reactions — Stellar-Conduct and Stellar Swirl — can CRIT and ignore DMG Bonus and enemy DEF entirely, and three of the five read the stats of up to four characters at once.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[15px] md:text-base\",\"children\":\"And here is the part that matters most: none of them fire on element pairs alone. Slam Electro into Hydro all day and you get ordinary Electro-Charged, forever, unless a specific enabler character is in the party. These are not new cells on the element grid. They are conversions of reactions you already know, switched on by specific passives. Knowing who holds the switch is most of the guide.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"id\":\"five-new-reactions-and-the-characters-that-switch-them-on\",\"className\":\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[#D4A853]/15 scroll-mt-24\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"var(--font-display)\"},\"children\":\"Five New Reactions, and the Characters That Switch Them On\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[15px] md:text-base\",\"children\":\"Each new reaction replaces a classic one when an enabler's passive — a Moonsign Benediction passive for Lunar, a Stellar Jubilee passive for Stellar — is present in the party.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"div\",\"table-0\",{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto mb-6 rounded-lg border border-[#D4A853]/15\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full text-sm text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",\"thead-0\",{\"className\":\"bg-[#D4A853]/10 text-[#F0C850] uppercase text-xs tracking-wider\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"className\":\"hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-0\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Reaction\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-1\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Elements\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-2\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Converts\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-3\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Enabler characters\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-4\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Added in\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",\"tbody-0\",{\"className\":\"divide-y divide-[#D4A853]/10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"className\":\"hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-[#c8c8d4]\",\"children\":\"Lunar-Charged\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 text-[#c8c8d4]\",\"children\":\"Electro + Hydro\"}],\"$L60\",\"$L61\",\"$L62\"]}],\"$L63\",\"$L64\",\"$L65\",\"$L66\"]}]]}]}],\"\\n\",\"$L67\",\"\\n\",\"$L68\",\"\\n\",\"$L69\",\"\\n\",\"$L6a\",\"\\n\",\"$L6b\",\"\\n\",\"$L6c\",\"\\n\",\"$L6d\",\"\\n\",\"$L6e\",\"\\n\",\"$L6f\",\"\\n\",\"$L70\",\"\\n\",\"$L71\",\"\\n\",\"$L72\",\"\\n\",\"$L73\",\"\\n\",\"$L74\",\"\\n\",\"$L75\",\"\\n\",\"$L76\",\"\\n\",\"$L77\",\"\\n\",\"$L78\",\"\\n\",\"$L79\",\"\\n\",\"$L7a\",\"\\n\",\"$L7b\",\"\\n\",\"$L7c\",\"\\n\",\"$L7d\",\"\\n\",\"$L7e\",\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\",\"\\n\",\"$L8c\",\"\\n\",\"$L8d\",\"\\n\",\"$L8e\",\"\\n\",\"$L8f\",\"\\n\",\"$L90\",\"\\n\",\"$L91\",\"\\n\",\"$L92\",\"\\n\",\"$L93\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4c:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"my-12\",\"id\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 pb-2 border-b border-[#D4A853]/15\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"var(--font-display)\"},\"children\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"blog-faq\",\"open\":true,\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-[#D4A853]/15 bg-[#0c0c18]/60 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer list-none [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left p-4 md:p-5 hover:bg-[#D4A853]/[0.03] transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-white pr-4\",\"children\":\"What are the Lunar reactions in Genshin Impact?\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853] text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 md:px-5 pb-5 text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The Lunar reactions are Lunar-Charged (Electro + Hydro), Lunar-Bloom (Dendro + Hydro) and Lunar-Crystallize (Geo + Hydro). They are converted versions of Electro-Charged, Bloom and Hydro Crystallize, and they only occur when a character with the matching Moonsign Benediction passive — Ineffa, Flins, Lauma, Nefer, Zibai, Linnea or Columbina — is in the party. Unlike their base reactions, Lunar reactions can deal CRIT hits.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"blog-faq\",\"open\":false,\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-[#D4A853]/15 bg-[#0c0c18]/60 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer list-none [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left p-4 md:p-5 hover:bg-[#D4A853]/[0.03] transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-white pr-4\",\"children\":\"Can Lunar reactions CRIT in Genshin?\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853] text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 md:px-5 pb-5 text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes. Lunar and Stellar Glimmer reaction damage uses the contributing characters' ordinary CRIT Rate and CRIT DMG, unlike classic transformative reactions such as Electro-Charged or Superconduct, which cannot CRIT by default. For the combined indirect damage instance, whether the hit counts as a CRIT is determined by whether the highest-ranked contributor's individual result was a CRIT.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"blog-faq\",\"open\":false,\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-[#D4A853]/15 bg-[#0c0c18]/60 overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"cursor-pointer list-none [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left p-4 md:p-5 hover:bg-[#D4A853]/[0.03] transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-white pr-4\",\"children\":\"What is Moonsign and what does Ascendant Gleam do?\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#D4A853] text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\",\"aria-hidden\":true,\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 md:px-5 pb-5 text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Moonsign is a Genshin team bonus that scales with the number of Moonsign characters in the party: one gives Nascent Gleam, two gives Ascendant Gleam. At Ascendant Gleam, Moonsign characters have certain talents and skills enhanced, and for 20 seconds after a non-Moonsign character uses a skill or burst they boost all nearby characters' Lunar Reaction damage by up to 36 percent, scaling off their own ATK, Max HP, DEF or Elemental Mastery depending on their element.\"}]]}],\"$L94\",\"$L95\",\"$L96\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4d:[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"id\":\"weekly\",\"className\":\"my-12 scroll-mt-24 rounded-xl border border-[#D4A853]/20 bg-[#0c0c18]/60 p-5 md:p-6\",\"aria-label\":\"Mythras Weekly signup\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[#D4A853]/70 mb-2\",\"children\":\"The Mythras Weekly\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold text-white leading-snug mb-2\",\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"var(--font-display)\"},\"children\":\"The week's guides, in one Sunday email\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#c8c8d4] leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":\"The week's new guides and updates across every game we cover, plus what's on in the Multiverse — events, community, the lot. Signing up creates a free Mythras account (that's the membership; the weekly is one of i